    text: '- Price: Cloud: 7-day free trial, then from $29 a month. Self-hosted: Free.\n- Where it runs: Cloud: On our servers, nothing to install. Self-hosted: On your servers, with Docker Compose.\n- Marketplace apps: Cloud: Already approved, connect with OAuth. Self-hosted: Register your own developer apps.\n- AI: Cloud: Credits included, or bring your own key. Self-hosted: Bring your own key, or run a local model.\n- Updates: Cloud: Automatic. Self-hosted: You pull new releases.\n- Code: Cloud: AGPL-3.0, the same code. Self-hosted: AGPL-3.0, change anything.',
