    text: 'Yes. Crossmart has an MCP (Model Context Protocol) server and a full REST API, so Claude, ChatGPT, Cursor or your own agent can create, edit and approve listings. Agents follow the same approval rules as people, so an AI tool cannot do anything your settings do not allow.',
